  "description": "Subtle Clue The Stock Market is Preparing For Its Next Leg Up 📈",
  "body_html": "<p>Happy Monday; some positive news that I forgot to mention last week. Many of you all know that one of the several reasons I think we have another euphoric leg upwards in the stock market…despite the consistent barrage of negative headlines 😒… is the fact that there are hundreds of volatility contraction patterns (VCPs) on individual names. There are too many of them, for them all to be lying. Additionally, I forgot to mention last week, a subtle clue has been presented to us:</p><p>What has been performing really well? Finance. The <a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/only-10-stocks-made-the-cut?r=4z8lgl\">StockTok ETF</a> is packed with the Finance sector, specifically regional banks, and has been crushing the S&amp;P 500. This is a clue, in that finance, normally, will lead the next leg in the stock market. Tech usually does as well, but the chip situation has hampered the sector. Regardless, I think with some patience…not getting caught up in mainstream news, or quivering over intraday movements…we will find ourselves with even more winning positions. </p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!y36X!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F7ef9bb34-b86b-464c-861a-9b72982b8088_879x808.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!y36X!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F7ef9bb34-b86b-464c-861a-9b72982b8088_879x808.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!y36X!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F7ef9bb34-b86b-464c-861a-9b72982b8088_879x808.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!y36X!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F7ef9bb34-b86b-464c-861a-9b72982b8088_879x808.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!y36X!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F7ef9bb34-b86b-464c-861a-9b72982b8088_879x808.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!y36X!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F7ef9bb34-b86b-464c-861a-9b72982b8088_879x808.png\" width=\"879\" height=\"808\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/7ef9bb34-b86b-464c-861a-9b72982b8088_879x808.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:808,&quot;width&quot;:879,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:64692,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:false,&quot;topImage&quot;:true,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/i/207768496?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F7ef9bb34-b86b-464c-861a-9b72982b8088_879x808.png&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!y36X!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F7ef9bb34-b86b-464c-861a-9b72982b8088_879x808.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!y36X!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F7ef9bb34-b86b-464c-861a-9b72982b8088_879x808.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!y36X!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F7ef9bb34-b86b-464c-861a-9b72982b8088_879x808.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!y36X!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F7ef9bb34-b86b-464c-861a-9b72982b8088_879x808.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\" fetchpriority=\"high\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"icon-noB79L\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2 icon-noB79L\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a><figcaption class=\"image-caption\">The StockTok ETF is nearing triple the performance of the S&amp;P 500. </figcaption></figure></div><p>Oh, and before anyone asks… the StockTok ETF is a basket of stocks. Each stock was bought with roughly the same amount allocation. I will update this basket around August 1st, and as of today, each of the 10 stocks look fine. I’m too lazy, nor do I want the responsibility, of making an actual ETF. Not to mention, there are normally fees associated with an ETF, and nobody wants that. </p><p>I am usually kind of quiet on Monday’s…the market is often times shaking off whatever dumb headlines hit mainstream media during the weekend. Bull trend remains intact, and we continue to just consolidate locally, for the broader market. </p><h3>One last note…</h3><p>If you are going to follow me, follow along 100%. Not 10%. Not 50% or 90%. All or nothing please. I make short form Finance content…its usually less than 2 minutes. I’m not asking for a lot here. </p><p>I intentionally reward those that watch entire videos, <strong>often posting a solid ticker near the end of a video.</strong> <span class=\"cashtag-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;symbol&quot;:&quot;$PBF&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"CashtagToDOM\"></span> and <span class=\"cashtag-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;symbol&quot;:&quot;$SUN&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"CashtagToDOM\"></span> were posted on 7/14. PBF is up 14.9% since then, and SUN is up 4.5%. Most of my calls will originate from the <a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/stocktok-summary-fc6?r=4z8lgl\">StockTok Screener</a>. PBF is up 37% since the first signal from that screener.   </p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!jjwN!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F633dc662-7d0e-48be-aab7-494b13db3f5e_1347x900.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!jjwN!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F633dc662-7d0e-48be-aab7-494b13db3f5e_1347x900.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!jjwN!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F633dc662-7d0e-48be-aab7-494b13db3f5e_1347x900.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!jjwN!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F633dc662-7d0e-48be-aab7-494b13db3f5e_1347x900.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!jjwN!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F633dc662-7d0e-48be-aab7-494b13db3f5e_1347x900.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!jjwN!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F633dc662-7d0e-48be-aab7-494b13db3f5e_1347x900.png\" width=\"1347\" height=\"900\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/633dc662-7d0e-48be-aab7-494b13db3f5e_1347x900.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:900,&quot;width&quot;:1347,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:186659,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:false,&quot;topImage&quot;:false,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/i/207768496?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F633dc662-7d0e-48be-aab7-494b13db3f5e_1347x900.png&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!jjwN!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F633dc662-7d0e-48be-aab7-494b13db3f5e_1347x900.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!jjwN!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F633dc662-7d0e-48be-aab7-494b13db3f5e_1347x900.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!jjwN!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F633dc662-7d0e-48be-aab7-494b13db3f5e_1347x900.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!jjwN!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F633dc662-7d0e-48be-aab7-494b13db3f5e_1347x900.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"icon-noB79L\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2 icon-noB79L\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a></figure></div><p>I don’t do this for clicks, views, etc. I don’t care about that. If I cared, I would not deactivate my TikTok for months at a time lol. I do it because the market is complex. So are social media algorithms. Sometimes, the only way to get a message out to people, on a complex, but important market topic, is to bait videos, as I did yesterday. Though I think we have a major market correction building…in the future… my video yesterday had nothing to do about the meltdown. It had to do with TikTok (potentially Oracle), intentionally not pushing any bullish videos, hurting retail investors. Nonetheless, ~60% of the comments were atrocious, and I could instantly tell who watched 10 seconds, and who watched the entire video. I’m actually sick of the short attention span people, and just outright blocked them. I am at a stage in my “Finfluencer” journey, that I do not care about followers or subscribers. <em><strong>I care about quality people, good people that provide thoughtful, constructive commentary and seek to help each other.</strong></em></p><p><strong>Thank you </strong>to all of you that actually digest the full 1 minute or 2 minute videos, many of you are here on Substack with me. You all make the day awesome and I have enjoyed getting to know many of you. </p><p>Lets see how the market starts the day off. Remember to not poop your pants the first few minutes at market open. Day traders are fighting institutional bots and algorithms (and often time losing)…so we will see where the market settles after those battles. </p><p>If you have any questions, as always, feel free to tag me in the <a href=\"https://open.substack.com/chat/posts/9f426ce5-4ad0-414b-8948-b111b7ad31b2\">Main Chat</a>. Or if you just want to come chat, we do that too. Finally…thanks for stopping by! </p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!qZIO!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fb79e95f0-85ba-47ba-ba1b-3f9ad72296cb_330x436.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!qZIO!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fb79e95f0-85ba-47ba-ba1b-3f9ad72296cb_330x436.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!qZIO!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fb79e95f0-85ba-47ba-ba1b-3f9ad72296cb_330x436.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!qZIO!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fb79e95f0-85ba-47ba-ba1b-3f9ad72296cb_330x436.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!qZIO!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fb79e95f0-85ba-47ba-ba1b-3f9ad72296cb_330x436.png 1456w\" sizes=\"auto, 100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!qZIO!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fb79e95f0-85ba-47ba-ba1b-3f9ad72296cb_330x436.png\" width=\"330\" heig